{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29889","headline":"病中闻河东公乐营置酒口占寄上 · 李商隐","name":"病中闻河东公乐营置酒口占寄上","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻驻行春斾，中途赏物华。\n缘忧武昌柳，遂忆洛阳花。\n嵇鹤元无对，荀龙不在夸。\n只将沧海月，长压赤城霞。\n兴欲倾燕馆，欢终到习家。\n风长应侧帽，路隘岂容车。\n楼迥波窥锦，窗虚日弄纱。\n锁门金了鸟，展障玉鸦叉。\n舞妙从兼楚，歌能莫杂巴。\n必投潘岳果，谁掺祢衡挝。\n刻烛当时忝，传杯此夕赊。\n可怜漳浦卧，愁绪独如麻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29889.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29889","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}